        <mxCell id="header-sub" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1e293b&quot; style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Every zoom on one canvas: the hub as it runs today and the AI landing zone down to its policies, controllers and kernels&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;Scope: on-prem K3s hub and the AI landing zone proposal of 2026-10-23 · drawn in full: what the proposals add (P0–P2, IA-1–IA-3) · faded: what already runs&lt;br&gt;Three sandbox tiers side by side: standard (runc), gVisor and Kata, each on its own worker node; a platform can offer one, two or all three&lt;br&gt;Out of scope: EKS and GKE internals (multicloud views) · RBAC and grants (access matrix) · CI pipelines&lt;br&gt;v0.1 · source: cnp-docs/architecture/cnp · each zoom view lists its own sources&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=11;fontColor=#475569;" vertex="1" parent="1">
